10
00:00:46,132 --> 00:00:49,665
Yes, he looks very young.

11
00:00:49,688 --> 00:00:52,156
Does he wear glasses?

12
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:55,793
Yes, he wears black glasses.

13
00:00:55,816 --> 00:00:58,249
Are his eyes big?

14
00:00:58,272 --> 00:01:02,047
His eyes aren’t very big.

15
00:01:02,071 --> 00:01:04,804
What kind of clothes does he usually wear?

16
00:01:04,827 --> 00:01:08,594
He always wears a blue shirt.

17
00:01:08,617 --> 00:01:10,817
Is he a good-looking teacher?

18
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:14,530
Yes, he’s very good-looking!

19
00:01:14,554 --> 00:01:16,921
Is he a kind teacher?

20
00:01:16,944 --> 00:01:20,618
He always has a smile and seems very kind.

21
00:01:20,641 --> 00:01:22,975
