23
00:01:27,117 --> 00:01:29,450
Does he have a loud voice?

24
00:01:29,473 --> 00:01:33,450
Yes, he speaks in a very loud voice.

25
00:01:33,474 --> 00:01:36,076
That’s easy to understand!

26
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:40,267
His watch is really big, by the way.

27
00:01:40,290 --> 00:01:42,168
What kind of watch is it?

28
00:01:42,191 --> 00:01:45,630
