189
00:11:13,602 --> 00:11:18,891
He has short, light brown hair.

190
00:11:18,914 --> 00:11:21,881
Are his eyes big?

191
00:11:21,904 --> 00:11:26,737
Yes, he has big, round eyes.

192
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:30,843
What was he wearing today?

193
00:11:30,867 --> 00:11:34,334
He was wearing a yellow T-shirt.

194
00:11:34,357 --> 00:11:38,629
Is there anything on the T-shirt?

195
00:11:38,653 --> 00:11:43,187
There’s a big monster design on the front.

196
00:11:43,210 --> 00:11:46,386
What color are his pants?

197
00:11:46,409 --> 00:11:50,142
He’s wearing blue shorts.

198
00:11:50,165 --> 00:11:53,498
What kind of shoes is he wearing?

199
00:11:53,521 --> 00:11:56,993
He’s wearing white sneakers.

200
00:11:57,017 --> 00:12:01,450
Was he wearing a hat?

201
00:12:01,473 --> 00:12:05,754
Yes, he was wearing a green hat.

202
00:12:05,778 --> 00:12:08,544
Is he carrying a bag?

203
00:12:08,567 --> 00:12:12,601
He has a small red backpack.

204
00:12:12,624 --> 00:12:16,319
Does he have any distinguishing features?

205
00:12:16,342 --> 00:12:20,876
He has a small mole on his right side.

206
00:12:20,899 --> 00:12:22,932
Got it.

207
00:12:22,955 --> 00:12:25,014
I’ll look for him.

208
00:12:25,038 --> 00:12:27,411
I’m so worried.

209
00:12:27,434 --> 00:12:29,567
Nice to meet you.

210
00:12:29,590 --> 00:12:32,190
Were you crying?

211
00:12:32,213 --> 00:12:34,251
Were you laughing?

212
00:12:34,275 --> 00:12:37,008
He was running around energetically.

213
00:12:37,031 --> 00:12:39,669
It looks like we’ll find him soon.

214
00:12:39,692 --> 00:12:41,492
Please, don’t worry.

215
00:12:41,515 --> 00:12:46,809
Oh, I see a yellow T-shirt over there!

216
00:12:46,833 --> 00:12:50,100
Is he wearing a red backpack?

217
00:12:50,123 --> 00:12:53,527
Yes, he is.

218
00:12:53,551 --> 00:12:55,084
That’s Takeshi.

219
00:12:55,107 --> 00:12:57,274
That’s great!

220
00:12:57,297 --> 00:12:59,535
Please be careful.

221
00:12:59,558 --> 00:13:02,558
Scene 7: What Makes My Favorite Singer So Special

222
00:13:02,558 --> 00:13:07,725
Who’s your favorite singer?

223
00:13:07,748 --> 00:13:13,314
I love Ren from Japan the most.

224
00:13:13,337 --> 00:13:16,539
