He has a small face and a high nose.

230
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:41,127
Does he always have the same hairstyle?

231
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:46,920
No, he changes it often, but it’s long right now.

232
00:13:46,944 --> 00:13:49,983
What color is his hair?

233
00:13:50,006 --> 00:13:54,539
It’s a beautiful silver right now.

234
00:13:54,562 --> 00:13:58,135
Silver hair is unusual!

235
00:13:58,159 --> 00:14:02,792
Yes, he shines so bright on stage.

236
00:14:02,815 --> 00:14:05,790
