237
00:14:05,814 --> 00:14:10,684
He has narrow, cool-looking eyes.

238
00:14:10,707 --> 00:14:14,483
Is he slim?

239
00:14:14,507 --> 00:14:18,873
Yes, he’s very slim but strong.

240
00:14:18,896 --> 00:14:22,030
What kind of clothes does he usually wear?

241
00:14:22,053 --> 00:14:25,942
He often wears a long black coat.

242
00:14:25,965 --> 00:14:28,365
That sounds really cool!

243
00:14:28,388 --> 00:14:31,265
Does he wear earrings?

244
00:14:31,288 --> 00:14:36,138
Yes, he has three in his left ear.

245
00:14:36,162 --> 00:14:38,397
Are his hands big?

246
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:43,220
His hands are big, and his fingers are very slender.

247
00:14:43,243 --> 00:14:45,976
What kind of voice do you have?

248
00:14:45,999 --> 00:14:50,566
He has a sweet, slightly deep voice.

249
00:14:50,589 --> 00:14:52,805
I’d love to hear it!

250
00:14:52,828 --> 00:14:56,461
I’ll lend you his CD next time.

251
00:14:56,484 --> 00:14:58,166
Thank you.

252
00:14:58,190 --> 00:15:00,123
I can’t wait!

253
00:15:00,146 --> 00:15:03,146
