273
00:16:05,019 --> 00:16:08,219
People with droopy eyes do look kind, don’t they?

274
00:16:08,242 --> 00:16:12,275
Yeah, he was always smiling.

275
00:16:12,298 --> 00:16:15,197
What was he wearing?

276
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:18,754
He was wearing a blue checkered shirt.

277
00:16:18,777 --> 00:16:21,043
Was he wearing jeans?

278
00:16:21,066 --> 00:16:25,066
Yes, he had on nice jeans.

279
00:16:25,089 --> 00:16:27,656
Was he wearing a watch?

280
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:31,012
He had a black sports watch on.

281
00:16:31,035 --> 00:16:33,721
Did he look young?

282
00:16:33,744 --> 00:16:37,111
He looked about the same age as Suzuki.

283
00:16:37,134 --> 00:16:39,612
They make a great couple, don’t they?

284
00:16:39,636 --> 00:16:43,515
Yeah, they looked so happy together.

285
00:16:43,538 --> 00:16:46,831
I can’t wait to meet him!

286
00:16:46,855 --> 00:16:50,455
Let’s all grab a meal together sometime.

287
00:16:50,478 --> 00:16:53,478
Scene 9: Finding Someone by Their Features

288
00:16:53,478 --> 00:16:58,127
There are so many people at this party!

289
00:16:58,150 --> 00:17:01,585
Where could Sato be?

290
00:17:01,608 --> 00:17:04,847
Can you describe Sato’s features?

291
00:17:04,870 --> 00:17:10,437
Sato has short hair and a slightly round face.

292
00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:12,693
Is she tall?

293
00:17:12,716 --> 00:17:16,396
No, she’s not very tall.

294
00:17:16,420 --> 00:17:19,453
What is she wearing today?

295
00:17:19,476 --> 00:17:22,709
She’s supposed to be wearing a red dress.

296
00:17:22,732 --> 00:17:26,666
There are about three people in red dresses.

297
00:17:26,689 --> 00:17:29,866
Is she wearing any accessories?

298
00:17:29,890 --> 00:17:34,056
She said she’d be wearing a pearl necklace.

299
00:17:34,079 --> 00:17:37,012
Is it that person in the middle?

300
00:17:37,035 --> 00:17:40,525
That person has long hair.

301
00:17:40,549 --> 00:17:43,045
Oh, you’re right.

302
00:17:43,068 --> 00:17:45,635
Her hair isn’t short.

303
00:17:45,658 --> 00:17:48,791
How about the person on the right?

304
00:17:48,814 --> 00:17:52,581
That person is wearing black glasses.

305
00:17:52,604 --> 00:17:55,770
Does Sato wear glasses?

306
00:17:55,793 --> 00:17:59,527
No, Sato doesn’t wear glasses.

307
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:03,188
Then it must be the person on the left.

308
00:18:03,211 --> 00:18:06,744
Does she have short hair and a round face?

309
00:18:06,767 --> 00:18:10,849
Yes, she has a really cute round face.

310
00:18:10,873 --> 00:18:13,276
Is her necklace pearls?

311
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:17,139
Yes, a white pearl necklace.

312
00:18:17,162 --> 00:18:20,041
And she’s wearing a red dress, right?

313
00:18:20,064 --> 00:18:23,598
Yes, a beautiful red dress.

314
00:18:23,621 --> 00:18:26,716
What color shoes are you wearing?

315
00:18:26,739 --> 00:18:29,939
I'm wearing black high heels.

316
00:18:29,962 --> 00:18:32,047
That's correct.

317
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:34,504
That's Mr. Sato.

318
00:18:34,528 --> 00:18:37,016
We finally found him, didn't we?

319
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:40,007
Let's go say hello together.

320
00:18:40,030 --> 00:18:43,030
Scene 10: Spotting a Handsome Guy in Shibuya

321
00:18:43,030 --> 00:18:48,286
I saw someone really good-looking in Shibuya yesterday.

322
00:18:48,309 --> 00:18:50,351
A guy?

323
00:18:50,374 --> 00:18:52,508
A girl?

324
00:18:52,531 --> 00:18:56,107
A tall guy.

325
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:59,304
How tall was he?

326
00:18:59,328 --> 00:19:03,863
He looked about 185 centimeters tall.

327
00:19:03,887 --> 00:19:06,687
He looked like a model.

328
00:19:06,710 --> 00:19:11,076
Yes, he had a great figure.

329
00:19:11,099 --> 00:19:14,133
What color was his hair?

330
00:19:14,156 --> 00:19:18,389
It was light brown with a perm.

331
00:19:18,412 --> 00:19:21,345
That's a stylish hairstyle.

332
00:19:21,368 --> 00:19:24,413
What did his face look like?

333
00:19:24,437 --> 00:19:29,124
He had sharp, big eyes.

334
00:19:29,147 --> 00:19:31,845
Was his skin fair?

335
00:19:31,869 --> 00:19:36,487
No, it was slightly tanned.

336
00:19:36,511 --> 00:19:39,345
He looked healthy.

337
00:19:39,368 --> 00:19:42,802
What was he wearing?

338
00:19:42,825 --> 00:19:47,158
He was wearing an oversized black T-shirt.

339
00:19:47,181 --> 00:19:50,052
What kind of pants was he wearing?

340
00:19:50,075 --> 00:19:54,043
He was wearing loose white pants.

341
00:19:54,067 --> 00:19:58,067
Was he wearing any necklaces or rings?

342
00:19:58,090 --> 00:20:01,574
He was wearing a long silver necklace.

343
00:20:01,597 --> 00:20:04,431
Did he have a bag?

344
00:20:04,454 --> 00:20:08,092
It was a small black shoulder bag.

345
00:20:08,115 --> 00:20:10,948
How old did he look?

346
00:20:10,971 --> 00:20:15,971
He looked about 22 or 23 years old.

347
00:20:15,994 --> 00:20:19,594
He might have been a celebrity.

348
00:20:19,617 --> 00:20:23,852
Seriously, everyone around was staring at him.

349
00:20:23,876 --> 00:20:26,689
I hope we see him again.

350
00:20:26,712 --> 00:20:29,968
I'll try going to Shibuya again today.